// PublishFoundryDashboardRequest reads every tile as the caller, an owner or
// admin, and keeps their outputs as the dashboard's public snapshot, at its
// link: a new one the first time or once the last one expired, the same one
// when published already. The snapshot is what the publisher reads; anyone
